            "text": "{\"title\":\"Peruvian Smoked Pork Belly Seco Stew\",\"readyInMinutes\":75,\"servings\":6,\"summary\":\"This hearty \u003cb\u003ePeruvian smoked pork stew\u003c/b\u003e brings a rich depth of flavor by infusing classic Andean ingredients with deeply aromatic hardwood smoke. The base features tender pork shoulder seared to perfection alongside spicy \u003cb\u003eaji amarillo paste\u003c/b\u003e and caramelized yellow onions. Simmered slowly in authentic fermented corn chicha de jora and rich homemade beef stock, the broth absorbs complex fruity and earthy tones while softening native yellow potatoes and sweet sliced carrots. Finishing the dish with bright green peas and freshly cut cilantro adds a vibrant color contrast and a herbal lift that balances the comforting meatiness. Historically rooted in traditional mountain cooking methods, this stew celebrates the robust culinary heritage of Peru with a modern smoky twist. Enjoy this satisfying main course hot alongside fluffy steamed rice or warm hominy corn tortillas. With generous portions of high-quality protein, essential vitamins, and invigorating spices, this dish makes a spectacular centerpiece for festive family gatherings or cozy weekend dinners.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":580,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":29},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":32,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":49},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":11,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":55},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":38,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":13},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":6,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":7},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":36,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":72},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":110,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":37},{\"name\":\"Sodium\",\"amount\":780,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":34},{\"name\":\"Fiber\",\"amount\":5,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":20},{\